    "question": "What is the penalty for an incorrect multiple‑choice answer in JEE Main, as mentioned in the study material for droppers?",
    "options": {
      "A": "-0.25 marks",
      "B": "-0.5 marks",
      "C": "-1 mark",
      "D": "No penalty"
